# Upstream IP list for forwarder.
#
# Copy this file to "ip.txt" next to the executable (forwarder.exe) and fill in
# the upstream addresses you want to rotate through. One IP per line. Lines
# starting with '#' and blank lines are ignored.
#
# When you run forwarder WITHOUT a <target> argument, every accepted connection
# is relayed to the next unused IP from this list, and no IP is used twice while
# the process is running. A list of N IPs therefore serves exactly N
# connections per launch.
#
# Example:
# 23.227.39.200
# 23.227.38.74
# 23.227.38.65
